WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.585
LOGAN ROY: Everything I've done
 in my life,

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:04.129
I've done for my children.

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:05.755
I know I've made mistakes,

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.175
but I've always tried
to do the best by them

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.218
because...

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:11.594
I love them.

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:15.098
THERAPIST: Have you thought
about the possibility

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:17.183
that your children
are actually scared of you?

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:18.435
Oh, fuck off!

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.813
I want a broadcast network.
I wanna see

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.940
what other news operations
we can sweep up.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.942
-Local TV?
-ROMAN ROY: Dad,
nobody watches TV.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:28.111
Why shouldn't we do
all the news?

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:30.280
Um, well, Kim Jong Pop,

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.615
because that's not
how things work in this country.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.784
KENDALL ROY: We have
 a major problem.

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:36.786
He's erratic,
he's making bad decisions.

00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:37.787
If he's not careful,

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:39.038
he's going to
destroy the company.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:40.373
Anyway, you gonna
do something'?

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:41.583
I think I'm the best option.

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.293
Oh right,
'cause you like playing boss?

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:45.795
KENDALL: This is my vision.

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.964
-I take over, you two under me.
-Under you?

00:00:47.964 --> 00:00:49.466
-Can we think about it?
-KENDALL: Yeah, of course.

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:50.675
Yeah, I've thought about it.
Fuck you.

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:52.844
CONNOR ROY: This family
 is broken

00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:54.304
and that has consequences.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.974
Take out the old man,
in with the new guard.

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:01.352
-LOGAN: Where you been?
-SIOBHAN ROY: I was meeting

00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:03.938
-about a prospective job.
-With your father's enemy?

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:06.191
Disagreeing with dad
is not treason.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:08.651
Do you want this enough
to go to war with your family?

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:12.864
It's rebellion!

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:15.366
Sabotage!

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:18.536
Deliberate attempt
to undermine my whole business.

00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:20.330
That's the death pit,
take a look.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.873
GREG: I feel like
 I might not like it

00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:22.957
in the death pit.

00:01:22.957 --> 00:01:24.209
Stock's gone below 130.

00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:25.627
We could death-spiral here.

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:26.669
Who's in charge right now?

00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:34.677
It's my company,
you are a fucking nobody.

